Definition of Done

All cache-related UI options removed.

Project Key completely replaced by Team Key.

Fetch Stories always retrieves live iTrack data.

Load Components always retrieves latest GitHub/Kubernetes data.

Existing Stories are deleted before refresh.

Existing Components are deleted before refresh.

Existing Commit records are deleted before Generate Report.

Existing Deployment Readiness records are deleted before Deployment Refresh.

Bulk repository delete methods are used everywhere.

No record-by-record deletion logic remains.

Last Component Refresh timestamp redesigned with improved UI.

Release Readiness header height reduced.

No regression in existing functionality.

No stale data remains after refresh operations.

Database always reflects the latest external source state after each execution.

Code is cleaned up by removing obsolete cache-related services, controller methods, repository methods, DTO fields, and UI components that are no longer required.
